# etoro-ui

eToro UI Component Library for React Native. 
It includes 40+ components ranging from a simple EtButton to more complex EtListItem or EtSelect to select a country.
Some are controlled, some uncontrolled. **Each component has a dedicated AGENTS.md file to explain its respective usage in more detail when needed.**

The "using-ui-components.mdc" rule file goes into details on how the UI kit should be used when building screens.

